  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">R</mi></math>&nbsp;be functions defined by<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\" columnspacing=\"1.4ex\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>After taking intersection we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Now, checking continuity at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>We get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence, discontinuous at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>And,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Hence, discontinuous at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>"
